<!-- 3. MEET DESTYNI -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fdr-grid">
      <div class="fdr-img reveal"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0649/6505/0626/files/FOUNDER_2.jpg?v=1781383334" alt="Destyni Triplett, RN"></div>
      <div class="fdr-txt reveal d1">
        <span class="ey">Meet Destyni Triplett, RN</span>
        <h2>I&rsquo;m a nurse who built the program I wish I&rsquo;d had.</h2>
        <p>I&rsquo;ve spent <b>9 years</b> mastering this craft and <b>over 250 women</b> have trained with me. I&rsquo;m a Registered Nurse, which means I teach hygiene, safety, and precision at a clinical standard most lash courses never touch.</p>
        <p>I built the Luxe Lash RN Method&trade; because I watched too many women pay for a weekend class, get handed a certificate, and get left to figure out the hard part, the <b>business</b>, completely alone. That is not training. That is abandonment.</p>
        <div class="fdr-rn">
          <p><span class="hl">A lash teacher can show you how to apply a lash. A Registered Nurse teaches you how to be trusted with somebody&rsquo;s eyes.</span> This is not just about clean tools. It is learning how to think, assess, consult, respond, and operate with professional standards when a real client is in your chair.</p>
        </div>
        <p>This is the program I wish someone had given me: the skill <i>and</i> the business, taught live, with me in your corner the whole way. No BS, no fake lifestyle. Just the truth and a real path to building something of your own.</p>
        <div class="fdr-stats">
